# Exam track — Theme: Tourismus am Heemechtsland — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
# The manifest id (tourism.01) is the authoritative identity; T1.01 is a label.
#
# Every sub-lesson mixes words AND sentences so each session alternates
# word-match and sentence-builder slots; the emphasis here is vocabulary.

@lesson T1.01 "Tourism Vocabulary"

# --- People & travel ---
@word d'Rees = the trip
@word den Tourist = the tourist
@word d'Touristen = the tourists
@word d'Heemechtsland = the home country
@word d'Saison = the season
@word den Transport = the transport
@word d'Hoteller = the hotels

# --- Places & nature ---
@word d'Stad = the city
@word d'Stied = the cities
@word d'Duerf = the village
@word d'Natur = the nature
@word de Bësch = the forest
@word d'Bëscher = the forests
@word d'Landschaft = the landscape
@word d'Aussiicht = the view
@word d'Schéinheet = the beauty
@word d'Schlass = the castle

# --- Culture & sights ---
@word d'Kultur = the culture
@word d'Geschicht = the history
@word d'Attraktioun = the attraction
@word de Musée = the museum
@word d'Muséeën = the museums
@word d'Festivaller = the festivals
@word d'Féierung = the guided tour
@word den Ausfluch = the excursion
@word d'Kichen = the cuisine
@word d'Erfarung = the experience

# --- Doing things ---
@word reesen = to travel
@word besichen = to visit
@word besichtegen = to sightsee
@word entdecken = to discover
@word wanderen = to hike
@word buchen = to book
@word fléien = to fly
@word genéissen = to enjoy
@word lokal = local
@word immens = very

@sentence
@lu Den Tourist bucht eng Féierung am Musée.
@en The tourist books a guided tour in the museum.
@distractor-lu Ticket
@distractor-lu kaaft
@distractor-en ticket
@distractor-en buys

@sentence
@lu D'Aussiicht vum Schlass ass immens schéin.
@en The view from the castle is very beautiful.
@distractor-lu Musée
@distractor-lu kleng
@distractor-en museum
@distractor-en small

@sentence
@lu Mir maachen en Ausfluch an d'Duerf.
@en We take an excursion to the village.
@distractor-lu Stad
@distractor-lu Rees
@distractor-en city
@distractor-en trip

@sentence
@lu Mir entdecken d'lokal Kichen.
@en We discover the local cuisine.
@distractor-lu kachen
@distractor-lu Hotel
@distractor-en cook
@distractor-en hotel
